flint-browser (1.0.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: tabbed Chromium-based browser with built-in
    EasyList/EasyPrivacy ad and tracker blocking, DNS-over-HTTPS,
    multi-connection turbo downloads with pause/resume, reader mode,
    private windows, HTTPS-first mode, session restore and zero
    telemetry.

